Package: murx
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: small persistent terminal multiplexer
 murx runs shells and terminal applications in named sessions with windows
 and split panes. Sessions keep running when clients detach, and several
 clients can attach to the same session.
